Gateway status unavailable: local router is not reachable.
Gateway data path: direct (opt-in) - at launch Claude Code/Codex send model requests straight to the selected gateway; the local router keeps MCP, channels, events and restart.
A running CLI keeps the gateway it was launched with until it restarts; direct mode has no live re-route.
